\viewkind4\uc1\pard\sa200\sl276\slmult1\f0\fs32\b\cf1 CalenRecall\cf0\b0\fs22\par
\par
A self-contained calendar journal for Windows and macOS. Recall memories across decades, years, months, weeks, and days. All data stored locally on your device.\par
\par

\fs28\b What is CalenRecall?\b0\fs22\par
\par
CalenRecall is a desktop journaling application built with Electron and React that lets you create, organize, and rediscover memories across any time scale. Navigate through time with an interactive minimap, write entries at any granularity \endash from a specific second to an entire decade \endash and search through years of journals in an instant. Supports 17 calendar systems, 37 themes, and full export/import.\par
\par

\fs28\b Features\b0\fs22\par
\par

\fs24\b Time Navigation\b0\par
\bullet  Five-tier timeline: day, week, month, year, and decade views\par
\bullet  Global timeline minimap with drag-to-navigate and entry indicators\par
\bullet  Smooth zooming between time scales\par
\bullet  Jump-to-date with quick navigation\par
\bullet  Color-coded entry density across your entire timeline\par
\par

\fs24\b Journal Entries\b0\par
\bullet  Create entries at any time scale: day, week, month, year, decade\par
\bullet  Time-specific entries with hour/minute/second precision\par
\bullet  Rich text content with full markdown support\par
\bullet  Tags, custom entry colors, attachments\par
\bullet  Link related entries together\par
\bullet  Archive and pin/favorite entries\par
\bullet  Entry versioning and history\par
\par

\fs24\b Calendar Systems (17)\b0\par
\bullet  Gregorian, Julian, Islamic (Hijri), Hebrew, Persian, Chinese (Lunisolar)\par
\bullet  Ethiopian (13-month), Coptic, Indian Saka, Bah\u225\'e1\'ed\par
\bullet  Thai Buddhist, Mayan Tzolk'in (260-day), Mayan Haab' (365-day)\par
\bullet  Mayan Long Count, Cherokee, Iroquois (13-moon), Aztec Xiuhpohualli\par
\par

\fs24\b Search & Recall\b0\par
\bullet  Full-text search across all entries\par
\bullet  Search by tags, dates, or content\par
\bullet  Quick navigation to found entries\par
\par

\fs24\b Themes (37)\b0\par
\bullet  Light, Dark, Auto (system preference)\par
\bullet  Classic Light, Classic Dark, High Contrast, Terminal, BIOS\par
\bullet  Forest, Ocean, Sunset, Red Rock, Australian Desert, Hot Spring\par
\bullet  NEON, Vegas 80s, Modern Minimal, Modern Minimal OLED, Aero\par
\bullet  Scholar, Archive, Librarian's Study, Research, Manuscript Room, Reading Room\par
\bullet  ON SCREEN, Elite, Journeyman, Temple of Light, Temple of Darkness\par
\bullet  Kallisti, Galactic Basic, Stellar Echo, Out There, The Real World, Football, Tabletop\par
\par

\fs24\b Profiles & Privacy\b0\par
\bullet  Multiple isolated profiles for personal, work, health, etc.\par
\bullet  Optional password protection with recovery keys\par
\bullet  Local storage only \endash no cloud, no telemetry, no accounts\par
\bullet  Data stored in SQLite under \f1 %%AppData%%\\CalenRecall\f0\par
\par

\fs24\b Export & Import\b0\par
\bullet  Export: Markdown, Text, JSON, RTF, PDF, DEC, CSV\par
\bullet  Profile-based export selection with metadata (author, copyright, etc.)\par
\bullet  Password-protected profile export\par
\bullet  Import from JSON or Markdown with progress tracking\par
\par

