\fs28\b Installation\b0\fs22\par
\par
\b Requirements:\b0 Windows 10/11 (64-bit) or macOS 11+ (Intel/Apple Silicon).\par
\par
\b Setup:\b0 Run the installer and follow the prompts. CalenRecall installs to Program Files and stores your journal data in \f1 %%AppData%%\\CalenRecall\f0. During uninstall, you may choose whether to keep or remove your journal data.\par
\par

